<body>
    <h1>Platform Integrations</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"PlatformIntegrations-StartingPrinciples">Starting Princip=
les</h1>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformIntegrations-PortalasLauncherversusPortalasWorkspaces">Po=
rtal as Launcher versus Portal as Workspaces</h2>
<p>The Compass platform has 2 functions</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9c044775-ece9-4d6a-8f7f-182f33240fff">The Portal acts as =
a <strong>composite workspace </strong>when multiple apps need to be visibl=
e together / users need to pivot quickly between those apps across the core=
 operational experience</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c38ec1cd-ed85-4e5b-a3ee-b730e2dd16a2">The platform is als=
o a<strong> launch point </strong>for the curated ecosystem for application=
s outside of the core operational experience.</li>
</ul>
<p>For the latter (i.e. Integrations), the role of the platform breaks down=
 as follows:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2f66130e-1419-486e-bae2-64676d39c37e"><strong>Primary rol=
e</strong>: enforce consistency and centralization of authentication, featu=
re access, data access, firm &amp; user context, user monitoring, and infor=
mation architecture</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cfdfc4a7-f5de-4b9c-bc04-7a27a4f566d6"><strong>Secondary r=
ole</strong>: facilitate selective application of design and integration st=
andards</li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformIntegrations-Selective&amp;ProgressiveIntegration">Select=
ive &amp; Progressive Integration</h2>
<p>&nbsp;(how the app was built / app integration capabilities, whether it =
is commissioned specifically for NBIN or purchased off the shelf, willingne=
ss to invest, strategic relevance, etc.) -</p>
<p>Due to the high % of 3rd party apps that will / make up the Compass plat=
form, it is often difficult to harmonize app build across multiple app prov=
iders due to the number of influencing factors which may result in many poi=
nt to point negotiations (contractual, ROI, app maturity and integration re=
adiness, prioritization conflicts, time-to-market needs, radius from Core o=
ffering). &nbsp;The platform does NOT fully enforce integration standards s=
ince the variability in 3rd party app partnerships for this reason as it wi=
ll be difficult to negotiate integration standardization, unless it's a cri=
tical core experience. &nbsp;Runtime composition (with tight integration) i=
ntroduces dependency governance, integration testing, version skew, monitor=
ing, fallback handling, and operational complexity.&nbsp; As a rule of thum=
b:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"721efb58-924f-498d-97a9-1b21b8e38b39">Micro-frontends are=
 most valuable when independent deployment across multiple teams is a hard =
requirement; otherwise, modular monolith or build-time integration can ofte=
n deliver better cost-to-value.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3c2835fa-ce0e-4044-a45c-c8d2ba7d54aa">Module federation s=
hould be used selectively for strategic in-house applications that need dee=
p in-portal UX integration and independent release cycles</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a7f2f64a-7970-47ee-8f0e-3174362203a1">Use simpler integra=
tion patterns =E2=80=94 links, embedded routes, iFrames, web components, or=
 packaged SDKs =E2=80=94 for lower-value, vendor-owned, or infrequently cha=
nged applications</li>
</ul>
<p>Typical application of integration tiers in a product ecosystem:&nbsp;</=
p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"06f848e0-544e-4872-9abe-705d3ca70749">70-80% Tier 1</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3d92ee54-ef2c-4f27-a1f9-ca4ad6160888">&lt;10% Tier 2</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"513462c9-6d02-45b4-95d3-d2e54b1f8817">10-20% Tier 3 (=3D=
=3D optimized core)</li>
</ul>
<p>Examples of discretionary integration standards include session synchron=
ization, session timeout intercept &amp; rerouting, micro frontend integrat=
ion, etc.&nbsp; See tiering below.</p>
<h1 id=3D"PlatformIntegrations-PlatformIntegrationModel">Platform Integrati=
on Model</h1>
<p><span>The tier determines the depth of integration, the review process, =
and the capabilities available to the integration.</span></p>
<p>integration solutions make onboarding, security, navigation, branding, a=
ccess control, upgrades, and support viable</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 97=
.4693%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 7.19551%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 8.44404%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 19.5899%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 20.8015%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 21.7593%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 22.2098%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTh" colspan=3D"2" data-highlig=
ht-colour=3D"#e6fcff" scope=3D"rowgroup">Integration Tiering</th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff" scope=3D"col">
     <p title=3D"">0 - Navigation-only</p>
    </th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff" scope=3D"col">1 - Unified Access (Default)</th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff" scope=3D"col">2 - Embedded Module (Rare)</th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e6fcff confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e6fcff" scope=3D"col">
     <p title=3D"">3 - Integrated Module (Premium)</p>
    </th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th rowspan=3D"6" scope=3D"rowgroup" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span>Integ=
ration Context</span>
     <br>
     <span>=20
      <br>=20
     </span><span>=20
      <br>=20
     </span><span>=20
      <br>=20
     </span></th>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Goal</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Ease of discoverability:</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"108a894b-0b08-4c3c-8c67-8346863fd668">Ensures users =
have an easy way to find available NBIN digital products subscribed by thei=
r firm</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Centralized access control:</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"510750d3-d3d2-4c5b-80a2-0882606c57bc">Seamless acces=
s for users to reduce multiple login frictions</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4297c50f-ff69-4ea0-8079-d4bd66e73d56">Traceability, =
maintainability and auditability in user access controls</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a316c515-f4d8-42d4-a96d-59a0c042e463">Navigation-onl=
y with Auth</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Context containment:</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2c2e8bee-5b73-4fb3-ab46-ba6860ca937a">Ensure users c=
an maintain simultaneous platform context when using an app</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Experience optimization:</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"93d91271-c7c4-4a68-89ef-a674cf65bc75">Ensure maximum=
 user efficiency and seamlessness of app functions</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Use Cases</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ab98e7d1-eaec-4a6c-b207-e1658601c46e">Features unrel=
ated to core journeys, where context continuity is not a concern</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f7345526-4b94-4861-8492-0a6de3e1ea05">Digital servic=
es for very specific groups/users outside of core platform experience</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"861de9b1-5931-40c1-aceb-12f99989bb62">New capability=
 where demand across segments is not yet clear</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"75d0352d-c2f7-4cd5-98cb-86e794de0464">Separate, seco=
ndary login is not a user barrier</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"43c89560-37ec-4599-8bc3-39bd8d33d676">No access cont=
rols required</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3a63becd-d2fb-455e-bfa4-eaea9cd4052a">Core or core-a=
djacent capabilities with low context continuity with core experiences</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0e8ded84-172f-4541-ab75-e40d509f0db1">3rd party part=
ners offering standalone products with no / low interaction with core exper=
ience</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dbf73631-d0c8-4b3e-833f-1ea3fb5817fc">Legacy tools o=
r reference applications where a deeper integration is not justified</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"138e2b6d-be03-4c64-bfdc-90eba3e92e63">New capability=
 where need is not yet clear for deeper integration</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"62ee6693-1e43-4fbb-9a6e-e091481ddbae">Apps with sepa=
rate release and support models</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5bb882a6-9f1e-4a07-b8f8-acdb728c821a">Apps that prov=
ide functions against a core or core-adjacent journey</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"29219446-b573-45cc-aa61-124cc687758e">3rd party apps=
 which fulfill the functions of a core journey</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"fc61f0b8-57b5-4dd3-a09f-4e6c67b70b1c">High-use workf=
lows / apps that provide functions against a core journey</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bed349e5-cb80-4f2b-ba78-95f06e19fe31">
       <p>Domain apps requiring seamless UX</p>
      </li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ddc1ae0f-b1e2-4aac-a9af-7af9d28a37af">Long-term part=
nerships with co-investment or customization appetite to maximize platform =
coherence for NBIN</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4ba47d4b-5859-4301-992a-824774c766ef">
       <p>Independent deployment is a hard requirement</p>
      </li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Platform Role</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0e61983e-ab48-455e-8d84-35c13b6d800e">&nbsp;Navigati=
on hub</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"02602d32-bd8d-4e65-aff3-5b249d4f525b">Secure app lau=
ncher and navigation hub&nbsp;</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li>Integration deployment governance</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Master workspace orchestrator</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Benefits</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c721d687-624b-499b-ba4e-6755baf5dddd">Cheap and chee=
rful</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"6339a741-5c6e-451d-98a9-e7321141545a">Ability for NB=
IN to track who has and uses what</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"cffde5d3-44c8-4e71-95d0-0c367a7bced7">Cheapest and f=
astest integration to implement</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b4bd98bb-a0d3-4388-a642-dc94d49f4ba0">Minimal depend=
ency on partners / 3rd parties</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1c9b5343-5ea7-4f3b-b09f-a823da67b00b">Auditable user=
 access</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a6b0684e-43ec-4803-83c0-509c51f8d824">Less costly an=
d easier to negotiate than Tier 3</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f3caa810-8c9f-470d-8507-4f74f426200c">Isolation betw=
een host and app</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e539b970-25b4-4068-93e7-414cc45877a6">Minimal fronte=
nd refactoring</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e03a4004-c153-4d98-a682-9ec67174f4e3">Can accommodat=
e different technology stacks</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c5d56676-175a-4cfe-ada9-926f9c4248a0">Best user expe=
rience</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"87262039-b1f7-43e6-bcc0-3015a95b2cd2">Most flexibili=
ty in supporting independent deployments</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"07fb522f-85dd-4421-9cf1-d65c12fa27b2">Enables seamle=
ss composition of pages, widgets, capabilities inside one cohesive portal</=
li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Drawbacks</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"42613ab5-7851-4053-b085-42a78b64c8ba">No access gove=
rnance</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"01fcbcea-30fe-4e76-8dee-adba40c86756">Fragmented use=
r experience
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"88b3d8a1-f514-41ba-a8fb-1987ab8ec143">No cross-app=
 workflows</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"ef7556c1-f237-46d3-9c10-f09b49f36352">No common UI=
 behaviors</li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"efa76314-dd95-4fc8-a044-07b96caa4556">More dependenc=
ies to manage, e.g. accessibility, responsive behavior, copy &amp; pasting,=
 pop-ups</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8a5b53fa-2050-4515-abd9-f8e35febe5c7">3rd party secu=
rity policies, restrictions, cookie behaviors can create run-time issues</l=
i>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c54ca860-baea-46ee-9b15-590b943eb022">Requires teams=
 with frontend engineering maturity</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dbb201fa-62c9-4aad-953a-e18a13ffe235">Expensive oper=
ationally</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c23fc70f-3fc8-469a-b65c-faea68c580da">Requires stron=
g dependency governance</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Examples</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"71693860-27ba-45b6-a6ff-588688ace569">Evercore Resea=
rch</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bb9cfc62-76e4-41c1-ae3d-7193975a3d45">FileCabinet UR=
L</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"337e73d5-706f-4d86-b12b-c677cd9c92a9">SecuredZone Ap=
ps</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dba55c72-b187-4aff-b738-7a5e2e169f11">Croesus&nbsp;<=
/li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e0898813-2186-4265-814c-c6457a779d7e">IIS Tools</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2dea596b-2ac0-4afc-98aa-1c4d5e87a179">SOMA (current,=
 partial)</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"92c4d452-70ee-4d14-99dc-d7c59288fb5f">Trade Allocati=
ons</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a4857568-238a-4f96-ab78-158d4c2ecec7">Core Orders&nb=
sp;</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTh" colspan=3D"2" data-highlig=
ht-colour=3D"#e3fcef" scope=3D"rowgroup">Integration Standards</th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <p title=3D"">0 - Navigation-only</p>
    </th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">1 - Unified Access (Default)</th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">2 - Embedded Modules</th>
    <th class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <p title=3D"">3 - Integrated Module&nbsp;</p>
    </th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th rowspan=3D"2" scope=3D"rowgroup" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span>Integ=
ration Scope</span>
