ate</li>
     </ul>
     <p>For true reference only, this should be a content management proble=
m.&nbsp;</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Tier 0, plus:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"67172e6f-1633-4b41-acf4-58bcdefdde25">Auth integrati=
on</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"68db17c7-0c07-4738-a5ad-1e2235307c59">Firm &amp; use=
r lifecycle integration</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"42440325-462f-4f21-8d03-bce65be1f151">Minimal firm &=
amp; user context passing</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8b6d9877-8026-4bfa-8e2a-94da34dc48dc">Session expiry=
 &amp; redirect</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
