    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2301e25c-2f17-4d9b-a9bb-464232ef6237">One or more re=
sources to be mapped into CX Feature Registry</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5b7d4b66-e72d-42f6-a68c-b7917462cb63">Resources are =
differentiated based on module vs. entitlement</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"cb1f88d1-3a0d-4339-897b-b79482517bcd">Core microapps=
 conform to access level (view, manage, control, process) and entitlement c=
ontrols&nbsp;</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span>Feature Package Assignme=
nt</span></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Two options:</p>
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ceaed63e-65c7-451c-8885-ae97211115d3">As mandatory r=
esource available to all firms (with firm + user election)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9fe7f49d-df15-4b6e-8833-68328d3be683">As mandatory r=
esource available by default for all firms and users (no election)</li>
     </ol>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li><span>For core modules:&nbsp;u</span>ser packages to be updated b=
ased on product capability model</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"af8a45a5-9a52-4559-801f-46876112b95e">For non-core m=
odules: register as add-on</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9b9a562d-3c3d-4be3-afe5-d2a1dabf4ff0">For all module=
s: firm packaging based on product bundling &amp; subscription model</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b52824f8-9d61-4c64-8847-439389e08d21">Platform gover=
ns the packaging of resources into features - app conforms to feature hiera=
rchy and access levels and exposes resources to align as such</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
