   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">UX <span>Integration</span></t=
h>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">N/A</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span>Partner app remains a standalone app, by the partner, has its=
 own navigation.</span></p>
     <p><span>Partner app entry point is governed by platform information a=
rchitecture</span></p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">For iframed/vendor apps, conformance may be =
partial.</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bc46585e-dc7f-4b6e-9ae9-cb71f544e0b0">Pieces of an a=
pplication will be continued by the platform and other modules</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ca320021-1fc5-416c-b252-771eff77d5b4">Platform speci=
fies:
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"dde935cb-cc4e-4d1b-ae7d-39aaa05b1cb4">Header behav=
iour</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"152db690-9d2d-4d4b-8043-2a4bb4c1ef82">Navigation p=
attern (Loading states,&nbsp;Empty states,&nbsp;Error states,&nbsp;Breadcru=
mbs)</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"45ab1e74-5356-4549-a9e9-9db233089313">UI elements =
(Button hierarchy,&nbsp;Typography,&nbsp;Spacing)</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"c55e7dcc-85cb-456e-b143-c0b86ee92322">Support/help=
 entry point</li>
       </ul></li>
      <li>See: <a href=3D"/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2726104730/Module+Federatio=
n">Module Federation</a></li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span>Module deployment</span>=
</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Link, launchpad tile</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span>Deep link + SSO, launchpad tile</span>=
</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>iFrame with SSO/token handoff&nbsp;</p>
     <p>Modular monolith</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Module federation, micro-frontend run time composition</p>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Partner builds a Module Federation r=
emote that mounts inside the Compass shell</span></p>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th rowspan=3D"3" class=3D"confluenceTh"><span>Platform Services Integr=
ation</span>
     <br>
     <span>=20
      <br>=20
     </span></th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><span>Notifications=20
      <br></span></th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"938900b5-858a-4ab5-8b9e-b67f7ee9f6ae">As required vi=
a desired Support channels off-platform</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"11859c86-0705-49ff-ada2-c69fb0727ed2">As required ba=
sed on features being introduced</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7340c8c7-ba3e-41d6-aa61-0ff6f568cb02">Event configur=
ation / classification against platform domain model</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Monitoring &amp; Alerts</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"83cfdebb-d8b5-453a-b36e-0765825befad">Register "feat=
ure" to facilitate outage / app-related communications via platform</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
    <td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Basic usage reporting on entry point</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"05f3fab1-7cd1-4394-932d-9ed543acf2c0">Daily / weekly=
 / monthly activity</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e53e0f4f-7e6f-4f2d-a505-92dedd8aecbd">Concurrent use=
</li>
     </ul>
     <p>Basic SLA reporting</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"22c8d164-5e1b-4f31-8c58-432b743f3fa0">Usage reportin=
g across available components</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9fe76b2e-0ca0-4dff-b4c2-b4eab727da6a">Transactional =
reporting where applicable</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"08620bed-ce0c-48b7-acb7-9066fdbe344d">Automated oper=
ational (system) alerting</li>
     </ul>
    </td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Logging</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">N/A</td>
    <td colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Provide auditable access logs</p>
    </td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <br>
    </td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p>Considered but not promoted to an integration standard:</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9e41b803-ce21-4fb6-b214-d98f47ce67e3">Web components, pac=
kaged components - need for reusable widgets from partners for core workflo=
ws is low</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d21102f1-9165-46d3-aa61-3fe119409a35">Single SPA / micro-=
frontend orchestration - framework for orchestrating multiple micro-fronten=
ds in the browser, we currently do not have the need to orchestrate multipl=
e existing SPAs, framework diversity is low in the bank</li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformIntegrations-IntegrationContract">Integration Contract</h=
2>
<p>Each app should declare:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a6ebb36d-4cc1-405c-94ab-1b101b386fac">How it authenticate=
s</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6617665f-515d-4dd2-ae10-05d84ad764f4">What user context i=
t needs</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"46eb1f55-b410-41c0-b806-9d70db8b4e04">Whether it supports=
 deep links</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a82d7d98-e973-4f21-b354-a5060c2279a7">Whether it supports=
 embedded mode</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"92c37871-f97c-40d5-b7d6-a7cb204cbe66">Whether it emits te=
lemetry</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"64dbf183-c482-4864-b0d1-5b2b7bf4dd27">Whether it supports=
 dark mode/accessibility standards</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5b6adef3-10b0-41f5-995f-2d00790c675b">How it handles erro=
rs</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4fce15cb-e4b3-4700-81fd-79a2adc079eb">What support route =
is shown to users</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"30fbd7d3-2d70-41d7-8f25-b1201ef13fe3">Whether it can be d=
isabled without redeploying the portal</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"PlatformIntegrations-RuntimeResilience">Runtime Resilience</h2>
<p>For module federation and embedded apps, the portal must handle failure =
gracefully.</p>
<p>Minimum requirements:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8e1a0024-1572-4ccc-82b3-b58542bf7f3e">Remote unavailable =
fallback</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"52f3f593-d7f8-4cd8-8cd5-0153814c691e">App loading timeout=
</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"567477fd-e5bb-47d2-9fc9-095cd10fcd4a">User-friendly error=
 message</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"272cbf07-7ff2-4a37-9099-5eddca74211e">Retry option</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"36979150-c738-44de-b084-4a904e069368">Logging/telemetry e=
vent</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9b0dff3d-e4c4-4046-af5a-b27a7f392250">Ability to disable =
app from registry</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c9560936-f22e-49a6-8fd3-4ec008b031f3">Rollback strategy</=
li>
</ul>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
<p>Example integration qualification triage&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 39=
.8178%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 36.6752%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 31.5508%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 31.774%;">
  </colgroup>
  <thead>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Question</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">If Yes</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">If No</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Is this app vendor-owned?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Link or iframe</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Consider deeper integration</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Is the app high-usage?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Consider native/federated</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Link/iframe likely sufficient</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Does it support cross-app workflow?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Federated or native module</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Link/iframe</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Does it need independent deployment?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Module federation</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Modular monolith</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Does it use a different tech stack?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">single-spa, iframe, or web component</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Standard React shell/module</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Is it a simple widget?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Web component or package</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Avoid MFE overhead</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p>
 <br>
</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
